        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The Company and the Union have specifically agreed that the terms and conditions set forth in this Letter of Understanding shall survive from year to year so long as a Collective Bargaining Agreement is in effect between the parties. It is further agreed that no additions, waivers, deletions, changes or amendments will be made to this Letter of Understanding unless by mutual consent of the parties in writing.",
